DESCRIPTION:Irene Tu is a LA-based stand-up comedian/actor/writer who honed
 
 her chops in San Francisco. Her 1st comedy album WE'RE DONE NOW debuted at
 
 #1 on the iTunes comedy charts. Paste mag praised the work\, citing Irene'
 
s "quick wit\, relaxed stage presence & hilariously off-the-wall observatio
 
ns." Among Netflix's "Introducing" comics of 2022\, her show in 2024 was na
 
med 1 of the funniest by the LA Times. A regular at festivals & clubs acros
 
s the US & she's opened for comics like Taylor Tomlinson\, Ronny Chieng & P
 
atton Oswalt. Online\, her many clips have gone viral\, amassing 30 million
 
+ views across platforms. Door Time: 6pm (front bar opens: 5pm). Show Time:
 
 7pm. 21 & over w/ valid\, government-issued photo ID. General Admission st
 
anding & seating. *Seating 1st come 1st served & not guaranteed. Arrive ear
 
ly for best selection. **If you have an accessibility request\, please emai
 
l thebellhouse@livenation.com. ***No outside food/drink. Tickets & info: ht
 
